[00:00.688]For the power of the sea
{"为了海洋的力量"}
[00:04.216]And the bright and shining stars
{"与璀璨闪耀的星辰"}
[00:07.577]A drop of breaking dawn
{"一滴破晓的晨露"}
[00:10.659]All the earth's in symphony
{"万物皆在交响中"}
[00:14.423]On the touch of a fingertip
{"在指尖轻触的瞬间"}
[00:17.861]Even just a tiny soul
{"即便只是渺小灵魂"}
[00:21.222]A sky so wide and bright
{"如此辽阔明亮的天空"}
[00:24.511]You can open all the doors
{"你能打开所有门扉"}
[00:28.317]
[00:43.148]You're overthinking everything
{"你总在过度思虑"}
[00:47.015]It makes you all confused
{"这让你困惑不已"}
[00:50.316]A lonely heart and soul
{"孤独的心与魂"}
[00:53.559]Right in the palm of your hands
{"正躺在你掌心"}
[00:56.462]
[00:56.856]Don't ever let your sight decide
{"别让视觉决定"}
[01:00.479]Who to trust and to believe
{"该信任谁信仰谁"}
[01:03.833]Never let the fear in your heart
{"永远别让心中恐惧"}
[01:07.249]Give you a reason to start a fight
{"成为争斗的借口"}
[01:09.779]
[01:10.138]One day you'll start to see
{"终有一天你会明白"}
[01:11.793]Gets better every day
{"每天都在变更好"}
[01:13.592]You'll feel it in your heart
{"你会从心底感受"}
[01:15.225]Can hear it in your voice
{"能从声音里听见"}
[01:16.864]Can see it in your eyes
{"能从眼眸中看见"}
[01:18.579]It's all what you become
{"这就是你的蜕变"}
[01:20.234]It's all of the proof you got here
{"这就是你存在的证明"}
[01:24.217]
[01:24.787]So ride along the wind
{"所以随风驰骋吧"}
[01:28.101]And go through heavy rain
{"穿越滂沱大雨"}
[01:31.302]Let the light fall into you
{"让光芒洒落你心间"}
[01:35.067]Believe a brighter life
{"相信生活会更加灿烂"}
[01:38.557]So open up your eyes
{"所以请睁开你的双眼"}
[01:41.519]Try to listen to the sound
{"试着聆听那声音"}
[01:45.036]Even through the darkest night
{"即使穿越最黑暗的夜"}
[01:48.628]Believe a brighter life
{"相信生活会更加灿烂"}
[01:52.304]You'll be surprised to find
{"你会惊喜地发现"}
[01:55.467]The colors bright and free
{"那些绚丽自由的色彩"}
[01:59.113]The sound and energy
{"那声音与能量"}
[02:02.510]The world is full of life
{"这世界充满生机"}
[02:05.877]So take my hand, we'll go
{"牵起我的手 我们启程"}
[02:09.224]A step to reach a goal
{"迈向目标的每一步"}
[02:12.599]We'll sing it out and loud
{"我们要放声歌唱"}
[02:16.126]And tell it to the world
{"向全世界宣告"}
[02:23.160]
[02:34.633]It's such a lovely place to be
{"这是多美好的存在"}
[02:38.525]Standing here beside you
{"站在你身旁"}
[02:41.749]And right now as I open my eyes
{"此刻当我睁开双眼"}
[02:44.899]I see the world I'm dreaming about
{"我看见梦中的世界"}
[02:47.697]
[02:48.416]I may not have the words to tell you
{"或许我难以言表"}
[02:51.753]But I know you understand
{"但我知道你都懂"}
[02:55.285]Walking to the same direction
{"朝着相同方向前行"}
[02:58.705]So I know you feel what I feel
{"所以我明白你感同身受"}
[03:01.199]
[03:01.611]One day you'll start to see
{"终有一天你会看见"}
[03:03.194]The darkness in the sky
{"天际的阴霾"}
[03:05.020]Will turn to brighter days
{"终将化作明媚晴天"}
[03:06.609]Believing in your heart
{"坚信心中所信"}
[03:08.360]Someday you'll realize
{"终有一天你会明白"}
[03:10.068]The journey that you have
{"你所经历的旅程"}
[03:11.704]Will make you rise and fall
{"会让你起起落落"}
[03:13.506]Just hold onto your dreams
{"只需紧握梦想"}
[03:17.197]
[03:17.913]So ride along the wind
{"乘风而行吧"}
[03:21.382]And go through heavy rain
{"穿越滂沱大雨"}
[03:24.422]Let the light fall into you
{"让光芒照进你心"}
[03:28.102]Believe a brighter life
{"相信更灿烂的人生"}
[03:31.531]So open up your eyes
{"所以睁开双眼"}
[03:34.717]Try to listen to the sound
{"试着聆听那声音"}
[03:38.117]Even through the darkest night
{"即使身处至暗之夜"}
[03:41.710]Believe a brighter life
{"相信更灿烂的人生"}
[03:45.405]You'll be surprised to find
{"你会惊喜地发现"}
[03:48.436]The colors bright and free
{"缤纷绚丽的色彩"}
[03:52.196]The sound and energy
{"那声音与能量"}
[03:55.622]The world is full of life
{"世界充满生机"}
[03:59.035]So take my hand, we'll go
{"握住我的手启程"}
[04:02.367]A step to reach a goal
{"迈向目标的步伐"}
[04:05.806]We'll sing it out and loud
{"我们要放声歌唱"}
[04:09.356]And tell it to the world
{"向全世界宣告"}
